### Reviews – variabili
@baseUrl      = http://localhost:3000
@reviewId     = 9856b1d7-2f99-4d56-ad68-2abcdc030715
@enrollmentId = 767d906c-1aed-4292-aa0e-5b1dcbafc41f
@studentToken = STUDENT_JWT_TOKEN

# NOTA: Review è legata 1:1 a un Enrollment (OneToOne).
# Non esiste GET pubblico delle reviews in questo controller —
# eventualmente sarà esposto tramite courses o enrollments.
# UpdateReviewDto = PartialType(OmitType(CreateReviewDto, ['enrollmentId']))
# → può aggiornare solo rating e/o comment, NON enrollmentId.

# ─── POST /reviews ────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### 1. Crea review – rating e comment
POST {{baseUrl}}/reviews
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}

{
  "enrollmentId": "{{enrollmentId}}",
  "rating": 5,
  "comment": "Corso eccellente, spiegazioni chiare e ben strutturato."
}

### 2. Crea review – solo rating (comment opzionale)
POST {{baseUrl}}/reviews
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}

{
  "enrollmentId": "{{enrollmentId}}",
  "rating": 4
}

### 3. Crea review – rating 1 (minimo valido)
POST {{baseUrl}}/reviews
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}

{
  "enrollmentId": "{{enrollmentId}}",
  "rating": 1,
  "comment": "Non soddisfacente."
}

# ─── PATCH /reviews/:id ───────────────────────────────────────────────

### 4. Update review – aggiorna rating e comment
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/reviews/{{reviewId}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}

{
  "rating": 3,
  "comment": "Rivisto il giudizio dopo aver completato tutti i moduli."
}

### 5. Update review – solo rating
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/reviews/{{reviewId}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}

{
  "rating": 5
}

### 6. Update review – solo comment
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/reviews/{{reviewId}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}

{
  "comment": "Commento aggiornato."
}

# ─── DELETE /reviews/:id ──────────────────────────────────────────────

### 7. Elimina review (204 No Content)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/reviews/{{reviewId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}

# ─── Edge cases ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### 8. Create – rating fuori range (atteso 400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/reviews
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}

{
  "enrollmentId": "{{enrollmentId}}",
  "rating": 6
}

### 9. Create – enrollmentId non UUID (atteso 400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/reviews
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}

{
  "enrollmentId": "not-a-uuid",
  "rating": 4
}

### 10. Create – enrollment inesistente (atteso 404)
POST {{baseUrl}}/reviews
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}

{
  "enrollmentId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000999",
  "rating": 4
}

### 11. Create – enrollment già recensito (atteso 409, OneToOne)
POST {{baseUrl}}/reviews
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}

{
  "enrollmentId": "{{enrollmentId}}",
  "rating": 5
}

### 12. Update – tentativo di cambiare enrollmentId (ignorato da UpdateReviewDto)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/reviews/{{reviewId}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}

{
  "enrollmentId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000999",
  "rating": 2
}

### 13. Update – UUID non valido nel path (atteso 400, ParseUUIDPipe)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/reviews/not-a-uuid
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}

{
  "rating": 3
}

### 14. Delete – review di un altro utente (atteso 403)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/reviews/{{reviewId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}

### 15. Delete – UUID non valido (atteso 400, ParseUUIDPipe)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/reviews/not-a-uuid
Authorization: Bearer {{studentToken}}

### 16. Senza token (atteso 401)
POST {{baseUrl}}/reviews
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "enrollmentId": "{{enrollmentId}}",
  "rating": 3
}
